From 1bd524cd525dbd3f4d2b62580b983b2b9f5c373a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rpc: add lock-free RCU ChainAndMempoolSnapshot and O(1)
 getblocktemplate / submitsealedheader

Add SnapshotPublisher RCU ring buffer, migrate read-only RPCs to lock-free
snapshots, wire PopulateMiningTemplate to CTxMemPool::GetOverlayManager()
in O(1) across all networks with compact V2 GPU miner template fields
(headerhex, coinbasetxhex, chainid, v2target, blocksize, mineraddress),
add submitsealedheader / submitsealedblock, and include unit tests in
snapshot_rcu_tests.cpp.
